# Backend API: origin only (app appends /api) or full base ending in /api
# Default in code if unset: https://www.comfortfoods.store → https://www.comfortfoods.store/api
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://www.comfortfoods.store

# PWA / OAuth base (see hooks/useSocialAuth.ts)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://www.comfortfoods.store

# EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Optional: Sentry DSN for mobile / PWA (https://xxx@xxx.ingest.sentry.io/xxx)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
